; Player - sleep timer button
; Btn.Timer.Accessible is the idle-state screen reader announcement
; (with the shortcut, per convention). Btn.Timer.Countdown is the visible
; button text while a timer runs ({0} = mm:ss, or h:mm:ss above 60 min).
; The Accessible.Active variant is announced on focus during a countdown;
; activating the button then stops playback and cancels the timer.
